  "Combat.Effect.Lurk.Name": "Lurk"
  "Combat.Effect.Lurk.Description": "You're poised to strike from a low angle, improving accuracy and critical chance."
  "Combat.Effect.Backbroken.Blocked": "You're still [b: crippled], and cannot use physical abilities."
  "Combat.Effect.Backbroken.Description": "You're crippled and cannot use physical abilities."
  "Combat.Effect.Backbroken.Name": "Back Broken"
  "Combat.Effect.Bleed.Description": "You are losing blood every turn until the wound closes."
  "Combat.Effect.Bleed.Name": "Bleeding"
  "Combat.Effect.BlocksMagic": "<b>Something is preventing you from focusing on a spell!</b>"
  "Combat.Effect.BrutalBlows.Description": "Enemy armor is reduced by each brutal hit."
  "Combat.Effect.BrutalBlows.Name": "Brutal Blows"
  "Combat.Effect.CirceScimitar.Description": "Living scimitars circle you, striking a random foe each round."
  "Combat.Effect.CirceScimitar.Name": "Summoned Scimitars"
  "Combat.Effect.Dazed.Description": "Target is dazed, compromising the accuracy and strength of his attacks."
  "Combat.Effect.Dazed.Name": "Dazed"
  "Combat.Effect.DivineWind.Description": "The blessed wind washes through the battlefield, healing those it touches."
  "Combat.Effect.DivineWind.Fades": "The wind's enchantment fades, and its healing properties vanish."
  "Combat.Effect.DivineWind.HealsFoe": "[pg-]The wind wraps around {0}, closing some of their wounds."
  "Combat.Effect.DivineWind.HealsYou": "[pg-]The blessed wind washes over you, mending your injuries."
  "Combat.Effect.DivineWind.Name": "Divine Wind"
  "Combat.Effect.ImaginaryMiffix.Name": "Miffix"
  "Combat.Effect.LustStones.Description": "Vibrating stones are lodged in your body."
  "Combat.Effect.LustStones.GooRound": "<b>The stones start vibrating again, making your liquid body ripple with pleasure. The witches snicker at the odd sight you are right now.</b>"
  "Combat.Effect.LustStones.Name": "Lust Stones"
  "Combat.Effect.LustStones.Round": "<b>The stones start vibrating again, making numbing waves of pleasure rattle your body.</b>"
  "Combat.Effect.Poison.Description": "Venom burns through your veins, sapping your health each turn."
  "Combat.Effect.Poison.Name": "Poisoned"
  "Combat.Effect.Poison.Round": "<b>You feel the poison burning in your veins.</b>"
  "Combat.Effect.PreventsPhysical": "You can't use physical abilities right now!"
  "Combat.Effect.Sandstorm.Description": "Grit stings your eyes and skin every round."
  "Combat.Effect.Sandstorm.Name": "Sandstorm"
  "Combat.Effect.Sandstorm.Round": "The sandstorm scours your skin!"
  "Combat.Effect.ScorpionVenom.Description": "The venom clouds your body: your aim suffers and spells often fail."
  "Combat.Effect.ScorpionVenom.Name": "Scorpion Venom"
  "Combat.Effect.Soulburst.Description": "Your soul burns bright: spell power surges, but your maximum health is halved per stack."
  "Combat.Effect.Soulburst.Name": "Soulburst"
  "Combat.Effect.TemporaryHeat.Description": "Something is making your body burn with unwanted arousal."
  "Combat.Effect.TemporaryHeat.Name": "Heat"
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.Applied": "They hit you before you can move, covering most of your nose and mouth and making it hard to breathe. You'll be unable to use your magic while you're constantly struggling just to draw air!"
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.BlocksMagic": "<b>The webbing over your mouth makes it impossible to focus on casting a spell!</b>"
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.BreakFree": "You rip off the webbing that covers your mouth with a cry of pain, finally able to breathe normally again! Now you can cast spells![pg]"
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.Description": "Silk is plastered over your mouth and nose, making it impossible to focus on casting spells."
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.Name": "Webbed Mouth"
  "Combat.Effect.WebSilence.Struggle": "<b>Your mouth and nose are obstructed by sticky webbing, making it difficult to breathe and impossible to focus on casting spells. You try to pull it off, but it just won't work!</b>[pg]"
  "Combat.Effect.Withering.Description": "Healing is turned against the target."
  "Combat.Effect.Withering.Name": "Withered"
  "Combat.Effect.Withering.NoLonger": "{0} is no longer withered, and can be healed normally!"
  "Combat.Effect.Withering.StillWithered": "{0} is still withered, and will take damage from healing."
